---Set Welcome Channel---
If its a private bot;you can just paste the welcome channel ID
If its a public bot;we need the variable named "welcomechannel".
1.Create a command
Trigger:ssetwelcome
2.Here is the code
/// Code ///
$nomention
$setServerVar[welcomechannel;$mentionedChannels[1]]
$color[#FFA500]
$title[Success]
$description[Set the welcome channel to <#$mentionedChannels[1]>]

